SQL> -- P_SOIGNANT : 3 sessions, idle 30 min, 5 échecs, verrou 15 min, vie 90j, grâce 7j, reuse 365/10, verify standard
SQL> PROMPT === Creation du profil P_SOIGNANT ===
=== Creation du profil P_SOIGNANT ===
SQL> CREATE PROFILE p_soignant LIMIT
  2    SESSIONS_PER_USER 3
  3    IDLE_TIME 30
  4    FAILED_LOGIN_ATTEMPTS 5
  5    PASSWORD_LOCK_TIME 15/1440
  6    PASSWORD_LIFE_TIME 90
  7    PASSWORD_GRACE_TIME 7
  8    PASSWORD_REUSE_TIME 365
  9    PASSWORD_REUSE_MAX 10
 10    PASSWORD_VERIFY_FUNCTION ORA12C_VERIFY_FUNCTION;

Profile created.

